<!--
  The source of the app's icons (direction A, rounded outline; chosen 2026-11-17, prototypes/icon-style/README.md).

  Each icon is drawn as centre-line strokes on a 16 × 16 grid with SVG elements (path, rect, circle). Avalonia's
  PathIcon only fills, so scripts/icons/outline-icons.cs strokes them with round caps and round joins and writes the
  filled outlines into src/Mindweave.Desktop/Themes/Icons.axaml. After changing this file, run

      dotnet run scripts/icons/outline-icons.cs

  and commit both files; IconResourceTests fails while Icons.axaml is older than this file.

  Rules (prototypes/icon-style/README.md, "选定方向的规则（A）"):
  - stroke 1.75 grid units for icons shown at 14 px or smaller (the default here), 1.5 at 16 px and up
    (stroke="1.5"; a glyph used at both sizes gets a second key with like="…" and its own stroke);
  - content inside 1.5–14.5, coordinates on multiples of 0.25, parallel lines at least 2.5 apart;
  - class="solid" elements are filled instead of stroked: only things that are blocks (the stop square, list bullets,
    the unread dot).
  The icon keys are stable names used by the views; keep them when redrawing a glyph.
-->
